# gigi

--- Daredevil_gadget_2 | gadget | TID_DAREDEVIL_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Gigi creates an area that makes herself and allies invisible while inside. Lasts <VALUE1> secs.
now  Gigi creates an area that makes herself and allies invisible while inside. Lasts <VALUE1> secs.
  VALUE1  -  -> 3

--- Daredevil_unique_1 | star power | TID_DAREDEVIL_SP_1_DESC
raw  Increases Super charge rate by <VALUE1>% if no damage has been received for <VALUE2> secs
now  Increases Super charge rate by 40% if no damage has been received for <VALUE2> secs
  VALUE1  40  -> 30
  VALUE2  -  -> 2

--- Daredevil_unique_2 | star power | TID_DAREDEVIL_SP_2_DESC
raw  SHADOW PUPPET now heals for <VALUE1> after charging up.
now  SHADOW PUPPET now heals for 1200 after charging up.
  VALUE1  1200  -> 2400

--- Daredevil_ulti | super | TID_DAREDEVIL_ULTI_DESC
raw  Gigi charges up for <VALUE1> sec, then appears at the targeted area. Gigi can charge up again for <VALUE2> sec to return to her starting position, dealing damage when she leaves.
now  Gigi charges up for <VALUE1> sec, then appears at the targeted area. Gigi can charge up again for <VALUE2> sec to return to her starting position, dealing damage when she leaves.
  VALUE1  -  -> 0.8
  VALUE2  -  -> 3
